00001| """pillars.py — HTTP clients for the five pillars (ARCHITECTURE 2: hub-and-spoke,
00002| APIs only; the root app NEVER bypasses a pillar's API).
00003| 
00004| Liveness right now (2026-09-06 build night): ollama :11434, genmedia :8931 and
00005| hub :8769 are up; ai_audio :8932 and archon :7843 may be down. Every function
00006| here tolerates any combination without raising (except ollama_chat, which the
00007| web layer turns into a 503).
00008| 
00009| REAL API shapes (inspected 2026-09-06, not assumed):
00010|   genmedia  POST /api/characters      FORM-encoded (FastAPI Form(...)):
00011|             name (required), description (required, becomes the canon block),
00012|             style_tags (comma-separated), category. Slug is DERIVED by genmedia
00013|             as slugify(name) (lowercase, non-alnum -> "_"). 409 on duplicate.
00014|             GET /api/characters -> [{slug, name, canon, refs, seed, ...}]
00015|   archon    POST /api/sandboxes       JSON {"name": str} -> sandbox dict
00016|             {id, name, library_id ("project.sandbox.<slug>"), ...}.
00017|             GET /api/sandboxes -> [sandbox dicts].
00018|             CLI fallback exists: python -m knowledge_core sandboxes create NAME
00019|   ollama    GET /api/tags -> {"models": [{"name": ...}]}
00020|             POST /api/chat (stream=false) -> {"message": {"content": ...}}
00021|   hub       GET /health -> {"ok": true, ...}
00022|   ai_audio  any HTTP response on :8932 counts as up (no fixed health route).
00023| """
